// Manual routing table for EC surface-like art tiles that cannot be resolved
// automatically from tileart.uop, TerrainDefinition.uop, and packed EC material
// provenance.
//
// Supported actions:
// - cc_art CC_ID TARGET mode="raw-cc" code="reviewed_raw_cc"
//   Render TARGET as Classic art even while running in EC mode.
// - cc_art CC_ID TARGET mode="resolve-ec" code="reviewed_cc_alias"
//   Restart EC surface resolution from TARGET. The resolver must reject cycles.
// - ec_material CC_ID TARGET package="Texture.uop" code="reviewed_direct_ec_material"
//   Route directly to a known EC material id.
// - ignore CC_ID code="not_ported_to_ec"
//   Treat the tile as transparent/no-render.
//
// Keep code values short and enumerable. The audit emits this as reason_code.
// Suggested initial codes:
// - unmatched_ec_port
// - reviewed_cc_alias
// - reviewed_raw_cc
// - reviewed_direct_ec_material
// - intentionally_hidden
// - not_ported_to_ec
//
// Unmatched candidates from the 2026-05-19 FP audit. Uncomment and choose an
// action only after manual visual review.
//
// ignore 39698 code="unmatched_ec_port"
//
// ignore 39699 code="unmatched_ec_port"
//
// ignore 39700 code="unmatched_ec_port"
//
// ignore 39805 code="unmatched_ec_port"
